borochid-driver-logitech-hidpp
Copyright 2026 Rodolfo Justiniano

HID++ 2.0 protocol facts (feature IDs, function numbers, DPI list encoding,
onboard profile commands) were learned from the public documentation and
behaviour of:

* Solaar (GPL-2.0), https://github.com/pwr-Solaar/Solaar
* libratbag (MIT), https://github.com/libratbag/libratbag
* the Linux kernel's hid-logitech-hidpp driver (GPL-2.0)

Only protocol facts were used; no code was copied. Device behaviour
(button numbers, host mode across power cycles, sleep) was measured on a
G502 X LIGHTSPEED with this repo's probe.
